---
description: Model selection and validation for time series (prices, load, forecasts)
globs: **/*.py,**/*.ipynb
alwaysApply: false
---
<!-- Distilled from the validation section of PatrickJS/awesome-cursorrules (CC0-1.0): automl-hyperparameter-optimization -->
- Split by time (walk-forward / `TimeSeriesSplit`); never shuffle across time.
- Fit scalers, encoders and imputers on the training fold only.
- Always report a naive baseline (persistence / seasonal-naive) next to any model.
- Report error in physical units (kW, EUR/MWh) as well as relative metrics; check errors by hour-of-day and season.
- Use this for forecasting and model selection only, not as a replacement for the physical battery model.
